    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "So when you say those views are \"outdated\" or \"misrepresentations,\" are you saying there's no legitimate scientific debate left on the topic? It feels like you're saying the debate is basically over and anyone questioning it is just wrong. Isn't there still room for discussion about the biological basis of sex vs gender?",
